Package: monkeylauncher
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtkmm-3.0-1v5 | libgtkmm-3.0-1t64, libcurl4 | libcurl4t64, libstdc++6, fzf, winetricks, xdg-utils, procps, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: mangohud, protontricks
Suggests: umu-launcher
Maintainer: SaruM4N3 <zakobajo@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SaruM4N3/MonkeyLauncher
Description: Launcher for online-fix Windows games on Linux
 A launcher for online-fix Windows games on Linux, built on top of
 umu-launcher and Proton. Available as a GTK3 GUI and a terminal CLI
 (fzf-based).
 .
 umu-launcher has no official Debian/Ubuntu package; install it manually
 from https://github.com/Open-Wine-Components/umu-launcher or run the
 project's install.sh, which builds it from source automatically.
